# CLIENT developer-tools config. Copy this file to client/.env.devtools
# (gitignored) and fill in the value.
#
# Vite loads it only for `--mode devtools` (npm run dev:devtools /
# build:devtools / preview:devtools) and only exposes variables whose names
# start with VITE_, so the name below must stay exactly VITE_DEV_SECRET.
#
# Required for developer authentication. It must equal the server's
# DEV_SECRET (server/.env.development). Note it is baked into the dev-tools
# browser bundle, so it is not confidential on its own — the server's check
# against DEV_SECRET is the real gate. Never set it for the normal build, and
# never commit the real value.
VITE_DEV_SECRET=
